{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"demon_horn","model_identifier":"demon_horn","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## demon_horn\n\nCarried load, monster goods.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (5 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.6..1.6, y -1.6..8.8, z -8.0..1.6 (size 3.2 x 10.4 x 9.6 u = 9 x 29 x 27 cm).\nDemon horn: a black, ridged horn about 30 cm along its curve (~12 u), gripped at its broad base and curving up and forward (-Z) to a point; six tapering segments rotated in 18 degree steps, a lighter ridge on each. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 1.6.\n"},"description":"## demon_horn\n\nCarried load, monster goods.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (5 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.6..1.6, y -1.6..8.8, z -8.0..1.6 (size 3.2 x 10.4 x 9.6 u = 9 x 29 x 27 cm).\nDemon horn: a black, ridged horn about 30 cm along its curve (~12 u), gripped at its broad base and curving up and forward (-Z) to a point; six tapering segments rotated in 18 degree steps, a lighter ridge on each. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 1.6.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"horn_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.3,-1.5,-1.3],"to":[1.3,2.3,1.3],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,0.3999999999999999,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8,0,10.6,3.8],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[11,0,13.6,3.8],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[14,0,16.6,3.8],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[17,0,19.6,3.8],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[16,4,18.6,6.6],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[19,4,21.6,6.6],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"80578e32-20f8-53